<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vôlei Gestão</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7f5;
            color: #20362b;
        }

        header {
            background: #20362b;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #d7f36b;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 420px;
            padding: 80px 8%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 560px;
        }

        .hero-text span {
            color: #6e8b36;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 46px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #66756c;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #20362b;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #31533e;
        }

        .ball {
            width: 220px;
            height: 220px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #d7f36b;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 90px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #20362b;
            box-shadow: 20px 20px 0 #dfe9df;
        }

        .cards {
            padding: 0 8% 60px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e1e8e2;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #718079;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 25px 8%;
            color: #718079;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            header,
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 15px 15px 0 0;
                display: inline-block;
            }

            .hero h2 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .ball {
                width: 150px;
                height: 150px;
                font-size: 60px;
            }

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Vôlei Gestão</h1>

        <nav>
            <a href="/">Início</a>
            <a href="/login">Entrar</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <span>GESTÃO ESPORTIVA</span>

                <h2>Organize sua equipe de vôlei.</h2>

                <p>
                    Gerencie atletas, equipes, campeonatos, partidas e desempenhos
                    em um único sistema.
                </p>

                <a class="button" href="/login">Acessar sistema</a>
            </div>

            <div class="ball">V</div>
        </section>

        <section class="cards">
            <article class="card">
                <h3>Atletas</h3>
                <p>
                    Cadastre jogadores, posições, números de camisa e equipes.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>Partidas</h3>
                <p>
                    Organize o calendário de jogos e acompanhe os placares.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <h3>Desempenho</h3>
                <p>
                    Registre estatísticas individuais e acompanhe a evolução dos atletas.
                </p>
            </article>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        Sistema de gerenciamento de voleibol — Temporada 2026
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
